/* Tour Cendrée : décor découpé dans les captures HGSS de la Tour Cendrée envoyées par Neocrizis (plancher, bords de trou en planches cassées, sous-sol, poutres brûlées, statues, piliers, rochers Éclate-Roc),
   planches tirées de la texture « Board Plank » d'Another Code: R (Wii), et braises « Flames & Ashes » de The Simpsons Bowling (modèle 3D rendu en 3 images de flammes + 1 éteinte). Voir CREDITS.md */
const TC = { img:null, fl:null, pl:null, PL:{plankA:[0,0,46,11],plankB:[48,0,38,10],plankC:[88,0,54,12]}, K:1.5, R:{"floor":[0,0,60,32],"b1":[61,0,40,20],"beamA":[102,0,36,19],"beamB":[139,0,24,16],"beamC":[164,0,36,28],"statue":[0,33,20,38],"shrub":[21,33,18,18],"rockY":[40,33,15,15],"boulder":[56,33,16,14],"pillar":[73,33,60,88],"edgeA":[134,33,64,90],"edgeB":[0,124,58,76],"ladder":[59,124,26,27]}, pat:{} };
(() => { const im = new Image(); im.onload = () => { TC.img = im; TC.pat = {}; if (LEVEL.burned) for (const c of chunkData.values()) c.canvas = null; }; im.src = "data:image/png;base64,"; })();
(() => { const im = new Image(); im.onload = () => { TC.pl = im; if (LEVEL.burned) for (const c of chunkData.values()) c.canvas = null; }; im.src = "data:image/png;base64,"; })();
(() => { const im = new Image(); im.onload = () => { TC.fl = im; }; im.src = "data:image/png;base64,"; })();
function tcSpr(g, n, x, y, k = TC.K, flip = false) { const q = TC.R[n]; if (!flip) return g.drawImage(TC.img, q[0], q[1], q[2], q[3], x, y, q[2] * k, q[3] * k); g.save(); g.translate(x + q[2] * k, y); g.scale(-1, 1); g.drawImage(TC.img, q[0], q[1], q[2], q[3], 0, 0, q[2] * k, q[3] * k); g.restore(); }
function tcPat(g, n) { // motif répété (plancher, sol du sous-sol)
  if (!TC.pat[n]) { const q = TC.R[n], c = document.createElement("canvas"); c.width = q[2] * TC.K; c.height = q[3] * TC.K; const x = c.getContext("2d"); x.imageSmoothingEnabled = false; x.drawImage(TC.img, q[0], q[1], q[2], q[3], 0, 0, c.width, c.height); TC.pat[n] = c; }
  return g.createPattern(TC.pat[n], "repeat");
}
function burnedChunk(ci, cj) {
  const R = rng(Math.floor(hash(ci + 3000, cj - 3000) * 4294967295)), x0 = ci * CH, y0 = cj * CH, K = TC.K;
  const holes = [], planks = [], beams = [], pillars = [], statues = [], ladders = [], embers = [], solids = [];
  const far = (x, y, m) => Math.hypot(x, y - START_Y) > 300 + m;
  const inHole = (x, y, m) => holes.some(h => x > h.x - m && x < h.x + h.w + m && y > h.y - m && y < h.y + h.h + m);
  if (R() < .5) { // un trou dans le plancher : on voit le sous-sol, bordé de planches cassées
    const w = Math.round((110 + R() * 90) * K), side = () => { const s = [], n = 1 + (R() < .45); for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) s.push(R() < .5 ? "edgeA" : "edgeB"); return s; }, L = side(), Rs = side();
    const hh = Math.min(...[L, Rs].map(s => s.reduce((a, n) => a + TC.R[n][3], 0))) * K, x = x0 + 40 + R() * (CH - w - 80), y = y0 + 30 + R() * Math.max(1, CH - hh - 60);
    if (far(x + w / 2, y + hh / 2, Math.max(w, hh) / 2)) { const bush = []; for (let i = 0; i < 2 + R() * 4; i++) bush.push([x + 50 + R() * (w - 100), y + 40 + R() * (hh - 70)]); holes.push({ x, y, w, h:hh, L, R:Rs, bush }); }
  }
  for (let i = 0; i < 3 + R() * 3; i++) { const x = x0 + R() * CH, y = y0 + R() * CH; if (!inHole(x, y, 40)) beams.push({ x, y, n:["beamA", "beamB", "beamC"][R() * 3 | 0], flip:R() < .5 }); } // poutres brûlées tombées au sol
  for (let i = 0; i < 2 + R() * 4; i++) { const x = x0 + R() * CH, y = y0 + R() * CH; if (!inHole(x, y, 50)) planks.push({ x, y, n:["plankA", "plankB", "plankC"][R() * 3 | 0], a:R() < .6 ? (R() - .5) * .5 : Math.PI / 2 + (R() - .5) * .4, flip:R() < .5 }); } // planches arrachées
  if (R() < .22) { const x = x0 + 70 + R() * (CH - 140), y = y0 + 140 + R() * (CH - 160); if (far(x, y, 70) && !inHole(x, y, 90)) pillars.push({ x, y }); } // grand pilier calciné du sous-sol
  if (R() < .3) { const x = x0 + 60 + R() * (CH - 120), y = y0 + 60 + R() * (CH - 120); if (far(x, y, 40) && !inHole(x, y, 50)) { statues.push({ x, y }); if (R() < .6) statues.push({ x:x + 80 + R() * 60, y }); } } // statues de pierre, souvent par deux
  if (R() < .06) { const x = x0 + 60 + R() * (CH - 120), y = y0 + 60 + R() * (CH - 120); if (far(x, y, 40) && !inHole(x, y, 40)) ladders.push({ x, y }); }
  for (let i = 0; i < 2 + Math.floor(R() * 2); i++) { // braises qui couvent sous les planches
    const x = x0 + R() * CH, y = y0 + R() * CH, r = 36 + R() * 20;
    if (far(x, y, 60) && !inHole(x, y, r + 20) && !pillars.some(p => Math.hypot(p.x - x, p.y - y) < 90) && !statues.some(p => Math.hypot(p.x - x, p.y - y) < 60)) embers.push({ x, y, r, ph:R() * 6 });
  }
  for (const h of holes) { const m = 34 * K * .5 + 10; for (let yy = h.y + 30; yy <= h.y + h.h - 22; yy += 34) for (let xx = h.x + m; xx <= h.x + h.w - m; xx += 34) solids.push({ x:xx, y:yy, r:24, hole:true }); }
  for (const p of pillars) solids.push({ x:p.x, y:p.y - 14, r:32 });
  for (const s of statues) solids.push({ x:s.x, y:s.y - 6, r:14 });
  return { ponds:[], trees:[], rocks:[], logs:[], mounds:[], holes, planks, beams, pillars, statues, ladders, embers, solids, canvas:null, used:0 };
}
function renderBurnedChunk(ci, cj) {
  const c = getChunk(ci, cj), x0 = ci * CH, y0 = cj * CH, K = TC.K;
  const cv2 = document.createElement("canvas"); cv2.width = cv2.height = CH * CH_SCALE;
  const g = cv2.getContext("2d"); g.scale(CH_SCALE, CH_SCALE); g.translate(-x0, -y0); g.imageSmoothingEnabled = false;
  g.beginPath(); g.rect(x0, y0, CH, CH); g.clip();
  if (!TC.img) { g.fillStyle = "#8f7a62"; g.fillRect(x0, y0, CH, CH); c.canvas = cv2; return cv2; }
  g.fillStyle = tcPat(g, "floor"); g.fillRect(x0, y0, CH, CH); // le plancher de la tour
  const G = 128; // traces de suie, sur une grille commune à tous les morceaux (pas de couture)
  for (let gy = Math.floor(y0 / G) - 1; gy <= Math.floor((y0 + CH) / G) + 1; gy++) for (let gx = Math.floor(x0 / G) - 1; gx <= Math.floor((x0 + CH) / G) + 1; gx++) {
    const h = hash(gx * 7 + 11, gy * 13 - 5), h2 = hash(gx - 99, gy + 77), x = (gx + h2) * G, y = (gy + hash(gx + 5, gy * 3)) * G;
    if (h < .25) { const r = 50 + h2 * 80, gr = g.createRadialGradient(x, y, 0, x, y, r); gr.addColorStop(0, "rgba(30,18,10,.32)"); gr.addColorStop(1, "rgba(30,18,10,0)"); g.fillStyle = gr; g.beginPath(); g.ellipse(x, y, r, r * .7, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); g.fill(); }
  }
  const all = { holes:[], planks:[], beams:[], pillars:[], statues:[], ladders:[] };
  for (let a = -1; a <= 1; a++) for (let b = -1; b <= 1; b++) { const n = getChunk(ci + a, cj + b); for (const k in all) all[k].push(...(n[k] || [])); }
  for (const h of all.holes) burnedHole(g, h);
  for (const l of all.ladders) tcSpr(g, "ladder", l.x - 13 * K, l.y - 14 * K);
  if (TC.pl) for (const p of all.planks) { const q = TC.PL[p.n]; g.save(); g.translate(p.x, p.y); g.rotate(p.a); if (p.flip) g.scale(-1, 1); g.fillStyle = "rgba(20,12,6,.3)"; g.fillRect(-q[2] * K / 2 + 2, -q[3] * K / 2 + 3, q[2] * K, q[3] * K); g.drawImage(TC.pl, q[0], q[1], q[2], q[3], -q[2] * K / 2, -q[3] * K / 2, q[2] * K, q[3] * K); g.restore(); }
  for (const b of all.beams) { const q = TC.R[b.n]; tcSpr(g, b.n, b.x - q[2] * K / 2, b.y - q[3] * K / 2, K, b.flip); }
  const tall = [...all.statues.map(q => ({ q, k:"s" })), ...all.pillars.map(q => ({ q, k:"p" }))].sort((a, b) => a.q.y - b.q.y);
  for (const { q, k } of tall) k === "s" ? tcSpr(g, "statue", q.x - 10 * K, q.y - 34 * K) : tcSpr(g, "pillar", q.x - 30 * K, q.y - 80 * K);
  c.canvas = cv2; return cv2;
}
function burnedHole(g, h) { // sous-sol de pierre (et ses buissons), ombre sous le plancher, puis les planches cassées sur les côtés
  const K = TC.K, tg = 40 * K; // les langues de planches avancent d'autant dans le trou
  g.save(); g.beginPath(); g.rect(h.x, h.y, h.w, h.h); g.clip();
  g.fillStyle = tcPat(g, "b1"); g.fillRect(h.x, h.y, h.w, h.h);
  for (const [x, y] of h.bush) tcSpr(g, "shrub", x - 9 * K, y - 9 * K);
  const gr = g.createLinearGradient(0, h.y, 0, h.y + 46 * K); gr.addColorStop(0, "rgba(6,8,10,.88)"); gr.addColorStop(1, "rgba(6,8,10,0)"); g.fillStyle = gr; g.fillRect(h.x, h.y, h.w, 46 * K);
  const strips = (list, right) => { let y = h.y; for (const n of list) { const q = TC.R[n]; right ? tcSpr(g, n, h.x + h.w - tg, y) : tcSpr(g, n, h.x + tg - q[2] * K, y, K, true); y += q[3] * K; } };
  strips(h.L, false); strips(h.R, true);
  g.restore();
  g.fillStyle = "rgba(20,10,4,.55)"; g.fillRect(h.x, h.y - 2, h.w, 3); // bord du plancher, en haut
  g.fillStyle = "rgba(255,236,200,.25)"; g.fillRect(h.x + tg * .6, h.y + h.h - 1, h.w - tg * 1.2, 2); // et en bas
}
function drawEmber(e, r, t, lit) { // tas de cendres, avec ses flammes tant qu'il ne pleut pas
  if (!TC.fl) return;
  const w = r * 2.3, hgt = w * 73 / 120, fr = lit ? 1 + Math.floor(t * 7 + e.ph * 3) % 3 : 0;
  cx.imageSmoothingEnabled = false; cx.drawImage(TC.fl, fr * 120, 0, 120, 73, e.x - w / 2, e.y - hgt * .72, w, hgt);
}
